# Force LF on every text file across platforms. Windows CRLF on a Next.js repo
# shows up as the whole tree "modified" (no real content change) and pollutes
# diffs/history.
#
# `text=auto` lets git detect text vs binary; `eol=lf` forces LF on everything
# detected as text — including extensionless files like .gitignore / .env.local.example.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets — never normalize.
*.png   binary
*.jpg   binary
*.jpeg  binary
*.gif   binary
*.webp  binary
*.avif  binary
*.ico   binary
*.pdf   binary
*.woff  binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf   binary
*.eot   binary
